#  This repository's files are consumed by Linux containers. A CRLF line
#  ending in a COPYed shell script yields `#!/bin/sh\r`, which fails with an
#  obscure "no such file or directory" and crash-loops the container. Windows
#  checkouts with core.autocrlf=true produce exactly that, and CI on Linux
#  never reproduces it.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
.env.example    text eol=lf
freeradius/**   text eol=lf
